{"id": "12490a5edfcf2dcd", "ts": "2026-10-02T00:12:42+08:00", "date": "2026-10-02", "source": "华尔街见闻", "title": "微软推出全新转录与语音模型", "content": "微软推出了转录模型MAI-Transcribe-2-Streaming，以及两款全新语音模型MAI-Voice-2.1和MAI-Voice-2.1-Flash。\n\nMAI-Transcribe-2-Streaming支持60种语言的实时转录，年底前优惠价格为每小时0.54美元；MAI-Voice-2.1定价为每百万字符22美元，MAI-Voice-2.1-Flash为每百万字符15美元。MAI-Voice-2.1支持23种语言和26个地区，并提供单一、跨语言一致的语音风格。", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.comhttps://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3173429", "symbols": [], "lang": "zh", "kind": "news", "ticker": "", "politician": "", "impact": 0.3767, "impact_parts": {"authority": 0.75, "burst": 0.0, "intensity": 0.6667, "relevance": 0.2, "theme": 0.0}, "sentiment": 0.6667}
